# Written by gaide init. Normalizes line endings so shell scripts, hooks and
# JSON stay LF on every checkout; a CRLF warning from git once made a secret
# scan abort and report success (see docs/adr/0006-cli-as-check-runtime.md).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
